    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. but why do you say they are \"legally flawed\"? it sounds like you're saying the dissent is just wrong. don't the dissenters have a legitimate legal basis for their stance, or is the majority opinion's logic the only one that actually holds up under legal scrutiny?",
      "source": "evaluator"
